        "synthetic_query": "Instagram portrait post, 4:5 composition, delicate hand-painted botanical watercolor as the key visual: translucent layered petals, fine leaves, visible paper grain and soft pigment blooms. Arrange a small cluster of flowers around the edges with generous warm-white negative space through the center; soft natural daylight, low contrast, muted sage, dusty rose and cream palette. Pair a graceful, personality-rich serif headline with restrained handwritten accents; keep all lettering crisp and readable at mobile size, no heavy outlines or digital-looking gradients.",
