        "synthetic_query": "Design a polished 4:5 Instagram course post with a simple mobile-first editorial grid: botanical watercolor hero area above, clear headline and short supporting copy in the middle, and a compact information block below. Establish hierarchy through spacing, alignment and type size rather than boxes; keep generous margins and a calm reading flow. Use warm ivory paper texture, muted green and blush accents, delicate serif typography with highly legible small text, and enough contrast for the course start date and six-week duration.",
        "rationale": "Oferece estrutura de post social e hierarquia clara para apresentar curso, duração e data sem comprometer a delicadeza visual."
